~ start
NPCS: What will you buy today?
if Global.wife_dialogue_progress < 1:
	PC: What?
	NPCS: What will you buy today?
	PC: There’s nothing to buy. 
	NPCS: …then why are you even here?
else
	PC: …
	- A bottle of liquor
		NPCS: $12.89. 
		NPCS: Have fun destroying your life, sir. 
		PC: What?
		NPCS: What?
		PC: …
		$> Global.has_alcohol_bottle = true
		=> END
	- A bag of fruit
		NPCS: We don't carry that.
	- A jug of milk
		NPCS: We don't carry that.
	- Nothing
		=> END
PC: Ah, my bad - I must have misremembered!
PC: Ha…ha…
PC: ??????????
=> END